<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Visakhapatnam Cargoes - Dec 11.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Visakhapatnam Cargoes - Dec 11.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Visakhapatnam port on December 11:</p>
<p> Commodity		Tons		  Ship	     Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Sulphur	   6,354 (ULD)    284     Arad		 11/12</p>
<p> Magnesia	  2,865 (ULD)  8,557     Yuan Da	    13/12</p>
<p> Urea		7,920 (ULD) 17,183     Jag Swakti	 20/12</p>
<p> Coking Coal    19,639 (ULD) 27,040     Kanpur	     16/12</p>
<p> Coking Coal     9,984 (ULD) 38,349     Patliputra	 20/12</p>
<p> Food Grains	 120 (LDD)    380     Akbar		12/12</p>
<p> Pig Iron	  8,000 (LDD)  6,700     Ais Mamas	  13/12</p>
<p> Wire Rod Coils 13,000 (LDD)  ----	Norbulk Teak     15/12</p>
<p> Thermal Coal   13,201 (LDD) 17,999     Chennai Polivu   14/12</p>
<p> Iron Ore	 51,800 (LDD) 41,700     Iolcos Mariner   15/12</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	    Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Visakhapatnam)</p>
